# Compliance guardrails for Cursor-generated changes
- NEVER hardcode API keys, secrets, or tokens; always load via os.getenv and .env.
- ALL trade execution logic MUST route through execution_engine.py to preserve rate limiting and kill switch checks.
- Do NOT bypass the LeakyBucket limiter with time.sleep for pacing; use the limiter utilities.
- Preserve JSON logging configuration; do not replace with print statements.
- Keep `.env`, secrets, and logs excluded from AI indexing (.cursorignore).
